# Final Fix Wave — Whole-Branch Review

Branch: `redesign/warm-premium`
Scope: `css/components.css` only (no JS, no HTML, no user-facing text changes).

## Finding 1 (Important) — `:focus-visible` destroys shape of pill/circle elements

**File:line:** `css/components.css:1178-1181` (bare `:focus-visible` rule)

**Edit:** Removed `border-radius: var(--r-sm);` from the bare `:focus-visible` rule. Kept `outline` and `outline-offset`.

Before:
```css
:focus-visible {
    outline: 2px solid var(--accent);
    outline-offset: 2px;
    border-radius: var(--r-sm);
}
```

After:
```css
:focus-visible {
    outline: 2px solid var(--accent);
    outline-offset: 2px;
}
```

Effect: `.tab-btn` (pill, `border-radius: var(--r-pill)`) and `.modal-close` (circle, `border-radius: 50%`) no longer have their shape overridden to `var(--r-sm)` on keyboard focus, since the equal-specificity, later-in-source `:focus-visible` rule no longer declares `border-radius` at all. Each element's own radius now governs, including its focus outline.

## Finding 2 (Important) — Three interactive targets below 44px minimum, two borderline targets made explicit

**a) `.btn-card`** — `css/components.css:341` — `min-height: 38px` → `min-height: 44px`. No other declaration in the rule touched.

**b) `.tab-btn`** — `css/components.css:562` (originally ~558) — `min-height: 40px` → `min-height: 44px`. No other declaration touched.

**c) `.modal-close`** — `css/components.css:838-839` (originally ~837-838) — `width: 38px; height: 38px;` → `width: 44px; height: 44px;`. No other declaration touched.

**d) `header nav a`** — `css/components.css:222` area. Replaced `padding: 9px 13px;` with:
```css
display: inline-flex;
align-items: center;
min-height: 44px;
padding: 0 13px;
```
All other declarations in the rule (`border-radius`, `color`, `font-size`, `font-weight`, `text-decoration`, `white-space`, `transition`) left unchanged.

Arithmetic check: `header nav` has `padding: var(--s3) var(--s1)` (vertical component still `var(--s3)` = 12px top + 12px bottom, only horizontal changed per Finding 4) → 44px (link) + 24px (nav vertical padding) = 68px, matching `--header-h: 68px` on `.header-container` exactly. Confirmed `--header-h: 68px` still appears exactly once in the file (`grep -c` = 1) and was not modified — header height is unchanged.

**e) `.lang-select`** — `css/components.css:258` area. Added `min-height: 44px;` and changed `padding: 8px 10px;` → `padding: 0 10px;`. Other declarations (`flex`, `margin-left`, `background-color`, `color`, `border`, `border-radius`, `font-family`, `font-size`, `font-weight`, `line-height`, `cursor`, `transition`) left unchanged.

## Finding 3 (Minor) — Dead selector `.contacts-info :focus-visible`

**File:line:** `css/components.css:1183-1186` (grouped focus-visibility rule, originally ~1186)

**Edit:** Removed the `.contacts-info :focus-visible,` line from the selector group. Kept `header :focus-visible` and `.price-card.featured :focus-visible`.

Before:
```css
header :focus-visible,
.contacts-info :focus-visible,
.price-card.featured :focus-visible {
    outline-color: var(--accent-on-ink);
}
```

After:
```css
header :focus-visible,
.price-card.featured :focus-visible {
    outline-color: var(--accent-on-ink);
}
```

## Finding 4 (Minor) — Focus ring on first nav link clipped

**File:line:** `css/components.css:202` (`header nav` rule, originally ~203)

**Edit:** Changed `padding: var(--s3) 0;` → `padding: var(--s3) var(--s1);` (4px horizontal added, vertical rhythm unchanged).

## Items deliberately left unchanged (per instructions)

- The four `!important` declarations inside `@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)` — untouched, count confirmed still 4.
- `--ink-2` — unused, left defined.
- `.page-container { flex: 1 }` — left as-is.
