- `.before-img` — no `width` added, still only `border-right` (confirmed).
- `.slider-handle` — no `left` added (confirmed); `.slider-handle::after`'s own `left: 50%` untouched.
- `.page-*` identifier classes and `.features-section` — no rules added.

